{"id":"n54741-1-8","stage":2,"title":"몸살 · 浑身难受","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54741-1-8-1","ko":"너 안색이 왜 그래?","zh":"你脸色怎么这么差？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안색이","meaning":"脸色，神色","explanation":"안색：脸色，神色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"안색","audio":"/audio/4228096eb5f0b5bf77d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66415","senseId":"1","lemma":"안색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래?","meaning":"那样（指脸色不好）","explanation":"그렇다：那样（指脸色不好）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"4228096eb5f0b5bf","term":"안색","zh":"脸色，神色","audio":"/audio/4228096eb5f0b5bf77d5.mp3","entryId":"66415","definition":"脸上露出的表情或光泽。","pronunciation":["안색"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样（指脸色不好）","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"那样（指脸色不好）","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/60af04ee741697c6bafa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54741-1-8-2","ko":"몸살 기운이 좀 있는지 식욕도 없고 그러네.","zh":"好像有点感冒的前兆，连食欲都没有呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몸살","meaning":"浑身难受，过劳而病","explanation":"몸살：浑身难受，过劳而病","readings":[{"term":"몸살","audio":"/audio/78bf29d1a4f75a6d621f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54741","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기운이","meaning":"先兆，前兆","explanation":"기운：先兆，前兆；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기운","audio":"/audio/f4dbd5949553c62639c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38086","senseId":"3","lemma":"기운","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는지","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식욕도","meaning":"食欲","explanation":"식욕：食欲；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"식욕","audio":"/audio/3af3fa404bbf974e8ceb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13990","senseId":"1","lemma":"식욕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없고","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"3","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그러네.","meaning":"是那样、出现那样的情况","explanation":"그러다：是那样、出现那样的情况；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"78bf29d1a4f75a6d","term":"몸살","zh":"浑身难受，过劳而病","audio":"/audio/78bf29d1a4f75a6d621f.mp3","entryId":"54741","definition":"身体过度疲劳时，全身酸痛无力、发烧的病症。","pronunciation":["몸살"]},{"id":"f4dbd5949553c626","term":"기운","zh":"先兆，前兆","audio":"/audio/f4dbd5949553c62639c7.mp3","entryId":"38086","d